pt.pdf","ts":"2026-07-23T18:40"}],"cm":{"items":[{"field":"summary","statement":"Record revenue: +16% to Rs 24,648 cr, PAT +17% to Rs 2,599 cr; grey-cement volume +12% to 41.31 MT; EBITDA/t Rs 1,214; capacity at 205.5 MTPA.","quote":"UltraTech Cement — Q1 FY27 (results 20 Jul 2026) Volume-led record quarter — growth well above industry, though per-tonne profitability rose only marginally as costs offset realisation. Numbers. Revenue Rs 24,648 cr (+16% YoY, a record); PAT Rs 2,599 cr (+17% YoY); EBITDA Rs 5,146 cr (+12%). Cement KPIs. Grey-cement volume +12% YoY to 41.31 MT (domestic +13% to 39.17 MT) — outpacing industry growt","doc_kind":"concall","kind":"written summary"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The company's capacity utilization, EBITDA, and profit after tax all increased compared to the same period last year.","quote":"Capacity utilization was stronger at 81% as compared to 76%, EBITDA of INR5,146 crores and PAT of INR2,604 crores which was up 17.2% over the last year same period.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The company's brand growth increased by 21.3% compared to the same quarter in the previous year.","quote":"In fact, if you look at the brand growth, the brand has grown 21.3% over the same period last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The company achieved domestic grey cement volume growth of 13.1%, which is expected to result in market share gains.","quote":"Our domestic grey cement volumes growth of 13.1%, I believe will be well ahead of industry's growth, translating directly into market share gains.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The company experienced a significant increase in imported fuel costs during the quarter.","quote":"We have absorbed and are absorbing the sharpest imported fuel cost shock in recent memory, during the quarter, on a volume base enlarged by acquired assets","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The company's fuel cost per ton increased by 5% to INR915.","quote":"Fuel cost, it's given in the presentation, from INR874, it went to INR915 per ton, which is a 5% increase.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The price of industrial diesel rose by nearly 50% to INR157 per liter.","quote":"And you didn't pay any higher price for fuel, but industrial diesel went up almost 50% from INR100 per liter to INR157.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management is highly confident about the company's performance in the upcoming quarters.","quote":"We remain very confident of a very bright future for the next quarter, the quarter after that and the quarter after that.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects the Eastern region to experience a strong demand upcycle over the next few years.","quote":"The structural change, which will be visible, it's not next quarter story, but it's next 2, 3, 4 years story. East will witness good demand upcycle.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company expects its grey cement capacity to reach 212.7 million tons by the end of fiscal year 2027.","quote":"We'll take our consolidated capacity beyond 242 million tons with grey cement capacity to reach 212.7 million tons by the end of fiscal '27","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company confirmed that the commissioning and product launch of its cables and wires project will take place in Q3 FY27.","quote":"We reaffirm commissioning and product launch in Q3 fiscal '27, October - December '26 quarter, precisely as committed to you when we announced this investment.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Management is confident that the company will maintain a net debt to EBITDA ratio below 1x for the current fiscal year.","quote":"Our belief is, and we are confident that this year also, we'll end the net debt to EBITDA below 1x.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The demand pipeline across infrastructure, housing, and urban real estate remains exceptionally strong.","quote":"But with a double-digit volume growth and a demand pipeline across infrastructure, housing and urban real estate is as rich as it can be.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The housing and urban real estate sectors, which account for the majority of India's cement consumption, started calendar year 2026 strongly.","quote":"Housing and urban real estate, roughly 55% to 60% of India cement consumption has a very strong start to calendar '26.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Cement prices remained constructive during the quarter, with all-India exit prices improving through June.","quote":"Cement prices have been constructive during the quarter in the report. Our all India exit prices improved through June even as the monsoon now sets in","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Cement prices are expected to remain stable during the monsoon quarter due to rising costs.","quote":"Industry expects prices to hold broadly steady through the monsoon quarter due to the impact of increase in costs, which, frankly, is a constructive outcome for this time of year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Fuel and packaging bags were the primary drivers of cost increases during the first quarter.","quote":"In the first quarter was fuel cost and packing bags. Packing bags was the biggest cost impact than fuel.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ULTRACEMCO1_23072026184045_SE_Letter_-_Transcript.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Higher diesel prices significantly impacted the company's limestone raising and raw material costs.","quote":"So this diesel is a very big component and limestone raising cost, which impacted our raw material costs.","doc_kind":"tra